      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-11-016\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23733]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>DRUG MISUSE:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23734]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Alcohol:</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23735]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If suspected use AUDIT test </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23736]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>AUDIT</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong> test</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>:</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong> </strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Is a </strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>10-item</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong> screening tool developed by WHO to assess alcohol consumption, drinking behaviors and alcohol related problems.</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23737]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Offer detoxification</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23738]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Manage in collaboration with mental health and substance misuse services</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23739]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Anomaly scan</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23740]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Identify risk of accidental overdose</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23741]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Offer treatment and support after child birth</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23742]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Neonatal assessment to rule out congenital</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>abnormalities and neonatal adaption syndrome.</span></p>",
